{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52887","headline":"野外遥[占]浑将军 · 史昂","name":"野外遥[占]浑将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山头一队欲陵（当作「凌」）云，白马红旗缨（此处衍一字）出衆羣。\n诸人气色不如此，只应者个是将军。\n（见伯三六一九卷、伯三八八五卷）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"史昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}